<h1>Amazon CodeWhisperer Review</h1>
<p class="company">by Amazon Web Services • AI Coding with Security</p>
<div class="rating-large">
<span class="stars">★★★★☆</span>
<span class="score">4.4/5</span>
</div>
<div class="review-meta">
<div class="meta-item">
<span><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="18" rx="2" ry="2" width="18" x="3" y="4"></rect><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="2" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="2" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg></span>
<span>Updated: November 2026</span>
</div>
<div class="meta-item">
<span>⏱️</span>
<span>9 min read</span>
</div>
<div class="meta-item">
<span><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="11" rx="2" ry="2" width="18" x="3" y="11"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"></path></svg></span>
<span>Security Scanning</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
